  "bodyHash": "6f092c9a4e782a42",
  "content": "\n\n<p><strong><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/7nr9m0q/Boosted-FPS.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"586\" height=\"78\"></strong></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>基於 Fabric 的整合包，內含效能優化模組與調整設定，讓您的 Minecraft 遊戲運行更流暢、更快速！完整支援 Sodium（請參閱下方設定說明）。此整合包現已支援 1.16.5、1.17.1、1.18.2、1.19.4、1.20.6、1.21 以及 Fabric 版的 26.1 版本。<br></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>Forge 版本請前往： <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/boosted-fps-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/boosted-fps-forge</a></strong></span></p>\n<p><strong style=\"font-size:24px\">NeoForge 版本請前往： <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/boosted-fps-neoforge\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/boosted-fps-neoforge</a></strong></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>Quilt 版本請前往： <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/boosted-fps-quilt\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/boosted-fps-quilt</a></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>RPG 版本請前往： <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/boosted-fps-rpg\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/boosted-fps-rpg</a></strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/LdG4vgH/Features.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"403\" height=\"64\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/675/498/2023-06-10_23.png\" width=\"1127\" height=\"634\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">(以下功能將進一步提升您的原版遊戲體驗)</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">最新版本 - 享受帶有新模組的最新更新！</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">FPS 效能提升 - 感謝 Sodium 移植版及其他效能增強模組。此整合包已內建大多數基於 Fabric 的效能優化模組。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">模組設定介面 - 遊戲選單中新增「模組」按鈕，列出已安裝的模組（亦可在此處進行模組設定）</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">額外生活品質 (QoL) 模組 - 讓您的 Minecraft 遊戲體驗更加愉快。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">預載 Hypixel 伺服器 - 已內建 Hypixel 伺服器連線，安裝即可遊玩！</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>原版（無模組）FPS：</strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/mFgNnsD/vanilla-screenshot.jpg\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>Boosted FPS 整合包：</strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/rMZBCHR/boosted-screenshot.jpg\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/P6pJTy8/Config.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"270\" height=\"86\"></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">渲染距離已設定為較低數值（例如 5）以最大化 FPS。若要查看更遠的距離，可將其調高至 8 或以上。您可以在&nbsp;選項 / 影片設定 / 一般 / 渲染距離 中進行更改。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">FPS 高於螢幕更新率或出現畫面撕裂？請在&nbsp;選項 / 影片設定 / 一般 中開啟垂直同步 (VSync)。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">若您的系統效能足夠，可在影片設定中的着色器 (Shaders) 區塊啟用着色器。</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/FAv8Axl7GIo?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/9mN4mjBuPXA?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/fYFU4QtCzEw?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/Ge32Bcch5UY?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/pmiSOeedr3k?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/3g58tPSTmpQ?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">今天就申請一台伺服器，與朋友一起遊玩吧！點擊 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fgamerpotion\" rel=\"nofollow\">這裡</a> 或下方的橫幅，並使用代碼 <strong>GAMERPOTION</strong> 即可享有 25% 折扣！</span></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fgamerpotion\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1068/671/53840b7f-f250-4a97-8995-c3544ae3e296.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1086\" height=\"180\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/uCPfPBvsRJ\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/958/418/join-discord.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"598\" height=\"187\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fgamerpotion\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/958/419/kofi.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"604\" height=\"165\"></a></p>",
